<title>UK: Royal Bank of Scotland raises mortgage rate.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank of Scotland raises mortgage rate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Royal Bank of Scotland said on Monday it is raising its standard variable mortgage rate to 8.45 percent from 8.20 percent with effect from September 1.</p>
<p>The move follows the Bank of England's decision earlier in the month to increase UK official rates by a quarter point to 7.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
</text>
